# /brag working output.
#
# The delivered cuts live in docs/cool-x-contrast/. What is ignored here is the
# bundled music and SFX (third-party assets this repository does not
# redistribute — the brag skill's own music README says the licence terms must
# be verified before redistribution), the render artefacts, and snapshots.
# The plan, the composition brief and composition/index.html ARE committed, so
# the video is reproducible: restore assets/ from the brag skill and re-render.
brag-output/
brag-output-*/composition/assets/
brag-output-*/composition/snapshots/
brag-output-*/composition/renders/
brag-output-*/composition/*.bak
brag-output-*/*.mp4
brag-output-*/*.jpg
